; Issue #3265: a commodity, payee or tag declaration was only recorded while
; strict checking was on, so declarations that preceded a --strict option
; given in the journal itself were forgotten, and every use of those items
; warned as if undeclared.  Account declarations were always recorded and
; never had this problem.

commodity EUR
payee Grocery Store
payee Bakery
tag Receipt
account Assets:Cash
account Expenses:Food

--strict
--check-payees

2024/01/01 Grocery Store
    ; Receipt: yes
    Expenses:Food    10 EUR
    Assets:Cash

; Payee is one of the tags ledger reads itself, and needs no declaration.
2024/01/02 Grocery Store
    Expenses:Food    5 EUR  ; Payee: Bakery
    Assets:Cash

test bal
             -15 EUR  Assets:Cash
              15 EUR  Expenses:Food
--------------------
                   0
end test

test payees
Bakery
Grocery Store
end test
